  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 6 * 14 * 2 * 1 * 11 * 52.\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) ×, ÷, -, +, = **\n\nGiven: 6 * 14 * 2 * 1 * 11 * 52\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 6 × __**14 ÷ 2**__ - 1 + 11 = 52\n\n⇒ __**6 × 7**__ - 1 + 11 = 52\n\n⇒ __**42**__ - 1 __**+ 11**__ = 52 \n\n⇒ __53 - 1__ = 52\n\n**⇒ 52 = 52**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) ×, ÷, -, ×, =\n\nGiven: 6 * 14 * 2 * 1 * 11 * 52\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 6 × __**14 ÷ 2**__ - 1 × 11 = 52\n\n⇒ __**6 × 7**__ - __**1 × 11**__ = 52\n\n⇒ __**42 - 11**__ = 52\n\n⇒ 31 ≠ 52\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ×, -, ÷, +, =\n\nGiven: 6 * 14 * 2 * 1 * 11 * 52\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 6 × 14 - __**2 ÷ 1**__ + 11 = 52\n\n⇒ __**6 × 14**__ - 2 + 11 = 52\n\n⇒ __**8**____**4**__ - 2 __**+ 11**__ = 52\n\n⇒ __95 - 2__ = 52\n\n⇒ 93 ≠ 52\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) ×, ÷, -, -, = \n\nGiven: 6 * 14 * 2 * 1 * 11 * 52\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 6 × __**14 ÷ 2**__ - 1 - 11 = 52 \n\n⇒ __**6 × 7**__ - 1 - 11 = 52\n\n⇒ __**42 - 1 - 11**__ = 52\n\n⇒ 30 ≠ 52\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
